  {
   "id": "02",
   "file": "02-diode-models.html",
   "title": "5 V 與 1 kΩ 串聯二極體，為何不是5 mA？",
   "params": [
    {
     "key": "a",
     "id": "c02-a",
     "type": "number",
     "label": "電源 VS（V）",
     "min": 0,
     "max": 10,
     "step": 0.1,
     "default": 5,
     "options": []
    },
    {
     "key": "b",
     "id": "c02-b",
     "type": "number",
     "label": "串聯電阻 R（kΩ）",
     "min": 0.1,
     "max": 5,
     "step": 0.01,
     "default": 1,
     "options": []
    }
   ],
   "formula": "恆壓降模型 I=max(0,(VS−.7)/R) mA；導通VD=.7，截止VD=VS。比較理想I=VS/R；分段I=max(0,(VS−.7)/(R+.02))；指數IS=1e−12 A,n=1,VT=.02585 V，求VS=RΩI+VT ln(1+I/IS)。",
   "example": "I=(5−.7)/1=4.30 mA；VR=4.30 V；5−4.30−.70=0；PR=18.49 mW,PD=3.01 mW，源21.50 mW。指數解VD≈.57415 V,I≈4.4258 mA。",
   "exercise": "VS=3.3 V,R=.68 kΩ：I=2.6/.68≈3.82353 mA；PR≈9.94118 mW,PD≈2.67647 mW；源≈12.61765 mW。",
   "scope": "PN形成/空乏區/內建電位V0=VT ln(NAND/ni²)與.7不同；順反偏/崩潰；IS/n/VT；rd=nVT/ID局部斜率；模型選擇。",
   "diagram": "串聯電路＋負載線兩截距VS與VS/R，恆壓降交點(.7,4.3)；標VD/VR/I並完整KVL。",
   "presets": [
    {
     "a": 5,
     "b": 1
    },
    {
     "a": 0.5,
     "b": 1
    },
    {
     "a": 3.3,
     "b": 0.68
    }
   ],
   "output_id": "c02-output",
